Z||000009||Black88GT||04-10-2001||12:12 AM||||We can't do anything that would be seen as an act of aggression, then all hell could break loose.  Think about it, is this really worth starting a World War?  China is just trying to get as much as they can out of all of this, and they want the U.S. to apologize to make us look bad.  I hope we do NOT apologize since we did not do anything.  There is so much that goes on behind the scenes that we have no idea about.  We get a slice of what goes on, and that slice is often dictated by the gov't.  Therefore its hard to say what we should do when we know very little about what is really going on.  <P>There are other ways to effect China then "nuking em" or blowing up the plane.  We can easily boycott all of their goods and ban any trading with them.  This would cripple their economy, I bet it would last 2 weeks before they were begging us to take the soldiers back and end the boycott.  It might hurt our economy TEMPORARILY, but its better then having a World War.  Keep in mind Bush has an awesome defense advisory staff, like Rumsfeld and Powell, they know there stuff.  Also like someone else said the super secret stuff was already destroyed before the chinese got a hold of the plane.  They will probably just try to salvage what they can, but this plane isn't a B-1 stealth bomber or anything, its not THAT top secret like so many media people have made it out to be (hell the Chinese already have most of our nuclear secrets, a couple secret camera's and radar equipment is small potatos).  <P>The bigger issue with China is the sale of naval ships to Taiwan.  This would help our economy greatly if we could get a contract with Taiwan to build as many as 30 ships for their defense.  But of course the commy bastard Chinese don't want Taiwan to be able to defend themselves.  Yet the Chinese have been selling weapons to Iran and Iraq for a long time now.<P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD - MAFOA<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://88database.homestead.com/files/AF.gif">  <BR><I>"Once you go black, you never go back..."</I>||||reg||1
