Z||000011||Songman||04-10-2001||02:20 AM||||The anti-Bush folks are loving it.. Something like 34% of people polled gave Bush an F rating on his handling of this. OF course, I don't see how they arrive at that, but as someone mentioned above this is all just a big politcal game. Too bad that it is not only America vs. China, it is also still Democrat vs. Republican. And who pays for it? The citizens of the U.S.<P>This is not involved in this same political game, but I am noticing the effects again of another political game that we play... Regular gasoline today was $1.45 at the pump. With all of the oil we have in our own soil, why does our gov't hurt the citizens of this country financially to stay in good with people that we don't like anyway?<P>I'm glad I'm not a politician. I would blow my stack..<P>Want to read some great political commentary by a real patriotic American? Go to  <A HREF="http://www.charliedaniels.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.charliedaniels.com</A>  and click the link for Charlie's Soapbox. It is fantastic!<P>Sorry I always get sidetracked in my posts, but things just sorta link together...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
Z||000012||firstfiero||04-10-2001||09:00 AM||||    The oil thing is easy...We want to make sure were the last to have oil when the rest of those middle east countries run out.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> And I have to disagree....I said put the country ahead of your life not a plane. In this situation their are alot of things on that plane china didn't know we have. Check your facts...Our only advantage over china is technology! It's definitly not man power. Their military is 3 or 4 times the size of ours. Our technology must be protected at all costs. That's why I never entered the military because I'm not prepared to make those kind of decisions but the men and women on that plane should have been. In my humble oppinion they made a bad one...and at the very least should a dishonorable discharge for it.<P>------------------<BR>Hey Mr. Ricer come over here and tell me how your stickers make you faster.....<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/headshot.gif"> <BR>Todd <BR>  86se||||reg||4
